ue, not a refusal. The session-config preflight applies only when work needs a worker. Never pushes.\"\"\"\n1421-rationale = \"\"\"Ordering only, no new authority: every refusal stays where it already lives, and the driver is ~400 lines of composition against the 4,042-line dispatcher it replaces.\"\"\"\n1422-test_refs = \"(see TC-137)\"\n1423-status = \"Approved\"\nPROCESS_OPTIONS bytes base=199839 tip=199478 delta=-361\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
